sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Resolvers (100 calls)
    participant DL as DataLoader
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    R->>DL: load(c1)...load(c100)
    Note over DL: collect keys in one tick
    DL->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE id = ANY($1)
    DB-->>DL: 100 rows in ONE query
    DL-->>R: each caller resolved
